<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>SoulMate ❤️ Find Your Perfect Match</title>
<style>
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box;font-family:'Segoe UI',sans-serif}
body{background:#fff5f7}
header{background:#fff;padding:14px 20px;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;position:sticky;top:0;box-shadow:0 2px 15px rgba(0,0,0,.08);z-index:10}
.logo{font-size:26px;font-weight:900;color:#ff4d6d}.logo span{color:#7b2ff7}
nav{display:flex;gap:16px} nav a{cursor:pointer;font-weight:600;color:#333;text-decoration:none}
nav a.active{color:#ff4d6d}
.btn{background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ff4d6d,#7b2ff7);color:#fff;border:none;padding:10px 20px;border-radius:25px;font-weight:700;cursor:pointer}
.hero{text-align:center;padding:35px 20px 10px}
.hero h1{font-size:44px;line-height:1.1}.hero h1 i{color:#ff4d6d;font-style:normal}
.hero p{color:#666;margin:12px auto;max-width:580px}
.tabs{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:8px;margin:18px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.tab{padding:9px 18px;border-radius:20px;border:1px solid #ddd;background:#fff;cursor:pointer;font-weight:600}
.tab.active{background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff}
.wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:auto;padding:0 20px 40px}
.page{display:none}.page.active{display:block}
.card{max-width:380px;margin:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 15px 40px rgba(0,0,0,.15)}
.card img{width:100%;height:420px;object-fit:cover}
.info{padding:18px}.info h2{font-size:26px}
.badge{background:#ffe0e6;color:#ff4d6d;padding:4px 12px;border-radius:20px;font-size:12px;font-weight:700;margin:6px 4px 0 0;display:inline-block}
.actions{display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;margin:18px}
.circle{width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:50%;border:none;font-size:28px;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 20px rgba(0,0,0,.12)}
.like{background:#ff4d6d;color:#fff}.pass{background:#fff}
.grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(230px,1fr));gap:16px}
.mcard{background:#fff;border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;cursor:pointer;box-shadow:0 8px 25px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.mcard img{width:100%;height:250px;object-fit:cover}.mcard div{padding:12px}
.form{max-width:480px;margin:auto;background:#fff;padding:24px;border-radius:20px;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.08)}
.form input,.form select,.form textarea{width:100%;padding:12px;margin:8px 0;border:1.5px solid #ddd;border-radius:12px}
.chat{max-width:600px;margin:auto;background:#fff;border-radius:20px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,.1)}
.chat-head{background:#1a1a2e;color:#fff;padding:14px;display:flex;gap:10px;align-items:center}
.chat-head img{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover}
.msgs{height:320px;overflow-y:auto;padding:14px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:10px}
.msg{max-width:75%;padding:10px 14px;border-radius:16px}.me{align-self:flex-end;background:#ff4d6d;color:#fff}.other{align-self:flex-start;background:#eee}
.chat-in{display:flex;padding:12px;gap:8px}.chat-in input{flex:1;padding:12px;border-radius:25px;border:1px solid #ddd}
.modal{position:fixed;inset:0;background:rgba(0,0,0,.6);display:none;align-items:center;justify-content:center;z-index:99}
.modal.show{display:flex}.mbox{background:#fff;padding:30px;border-radius:24px;text-align:center;width:90%;max-width:340px}
footer{text-align:center;padding:20px;color:#999}
@media(max-width:600px){.hero h1{font-size:32px}nav{display:none}.card img{height:340px}}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<header><div class="logo">Soul<span>Mate</span> ❤️</div><nav><a class="active" onclick="go('discover',this)">Discover</a><a onclick="go('matches',this)">Matches</a><a onclick="go('chat',this)">Chat</a><a onclick="go('profile',this)">My Profile</a></nav><button class="btn" onclick="go('profile',null)">Join Free</button></header>

<div class="hero"><h1>Find Your <i>SoulMate</i><br>Not Just a Match.</h1><p>Real people. Real vibes. Real connections. Swipe, Match & Start Your Love Story.</p>
<div class="tabs"><button class="tab active" onclick="filter('All',this)">All</button><button class="tab" onclick="filter('Girl',this)">Girls</button><button class="tab" onclick="filter('Boy',this)">Boys</button><button class="tab" onclick="filter('Nearby',this)">Nearby 📍</button></div></div>

<div class="wrap">
<div id="discover" class="page active"><div id="cardArea"></div><div class="actions"><button class="circle pass" onclick="swipe('pass')">✖️</button><button class="circle" onclick="swipe('super')">⭐</button><button class="circle like" onclick="swipe('like')">❤️</button></div><p id="counter" style="text-align:center;color:#888"></p></div>
<div id="matches" class="page"><h2>Your Matches 💘</h2><br><div class="grid" id="matchesGrid"></div></div>
<div id="chat" class="page"><div class="chat"><div class="chat-head"><img id="chatImg" src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=200"><div><b id="chatName">Aanya, 22</b><br><small style="color:#7CFC00">● Online</small></div></div><div class="msgs" id="msgs"><div class="msg other">Heyy! Your profile is really cute 😊</div><div class="msg me">Thank you! Yours too ❤️</div><div class="msg other">Coffee or long drive? ☕🚗</div></div><div class="chat-in"><input id="chatInput" placeholder="Type a message..."><button class="btn" onclick="sendMsg()">Send</button></div></div></div>
<div id="profile" class="page"><div class="form"><h2>Create Your Profile</h2><input id="myName" placeholder="Your Name"><input id="myAge" type="number" placeholder="Your Age"><select><option>Girl</option><option>Boy</option></select><input placeholder="Your City - e.g. Mau Ranipur"><textarea placeholder="About yourself..."></textarea><button class="btn" style="width:100%" onclick="saveProfile()">Create Profile →</button><p id="pMsg" style="text-align:center;color:green;font-weight:700;margin-top:10px